{
  "schema_version": "text-light-input-1.0",
  "unit_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_u01",
  "video_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4",
  "account": "赵健的读书日记",
  "source_title": "诸君，如果你很年轻就懂得灰度思维，那你将会成为家族里第一个跳出二元陷阱、看清世界本来模样的人，你会发现，其实身边的每一个人都没有绝对的好坏与对错，只是处在不同的角度和环境下，显化出不同的状态和做出的不同的选择。明白这一点的那一刻，你心里才会生出真正的爱与慈悲，允许一切发生。#成长 #治愈 #心理学 #读书",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 154.645011,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "周君，如果你很年轻，就懂得灰度思维，那么你会成为整个家族里第一个跳出二元陷阱，看清世界本来模样的人。你往上翻三代，你会发现他们总是习惯把事情分成两类，不是对，就是错，不是好人，就是坏人。一次成功说明选对了，一次失败就证明这条路彻底不行。但是从你这代开始，你懂得，不再急着把人和事情下结论，而是先看程度、条件和变化。人与人之间真正的差距往往不是谁的态度更坚决，而是谁能够在别人节着战队的时候，看见那些被忽略的另一部分，这就是灰度思维。终有一天你会发现，其实身边的每一个人都没有绝对的好坏与对错，只是处在不同的角度和环境下，显化出不同的状态和做出一同选择。明白这一点的那一刻，你心里才会生出真正的爱与慈悲。你开始接纳，学会包容，懂得善待，最终允许一切发生。道德经说知其雄，守其雌为天下息。鲁迅先生说古之成大事者，必是北人南向南人北巷之人。南北代表的是刚强和柔美，只有都通透了，人才能接受多样性。我没有资格去评判身边的任何一个人。因为每个人生长的环境不同，三观自然天差地别，做出了选择也不同。我不能用我有限的眼界去丈量别人的人生，更不能用我自己的标识去苛责别人的选择。如果换我拿了他的人生剧本，未必能演得比他还要好，所以，永远不要只盯着一个人的缺点，却忽略了他背后不为人知的困境。比如，判断一个人，他帮过你一次，不代表他永远可靠。他犯过一次错，也不代表他所有的地方都很差，真正要看的是他在什么情况下值得信任。犯错以后愿不愿意承担责任。人很容易在失败时彻底否定自己，也会在顺利时高估判断。所以你知道一个人见过世面的最高境界是什么吗？您身边有没有这样一种人，就是他看上去没有任何攻击性，你就是觉得他很厉害，而且和他相处总是觉得很舒服。这才是真正见过世面的认知高手。这就是鹤光同尘，这可不是同流合污稀里糊涂的混日子，而是一种顶级的智慧和修行。错其锐，解其纷，和其光同其尘。把自己当别人，这叫无误。把别人当自己，这叫慈悲。把别人当别人，这叫智慧。把自己当自己，这叫自在。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00001",
      "start_ms": 170,
      "end_ms": 530,
      "text": "周君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00002",
      "start_ms": 930,
      "end_ms": 1870,
      "text": "如果你很年轻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00003",
      "start_ms": 1870,
      "end_ms": 3330,
      "text": "就懂得灰度思维，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3450,
      "end_ms": 7110,
      "text": "那么你会成为整个家族里第一个跳出二元陷阱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00005",
      "start_ms": 7270,
      "end_ms": 9130,
      "text": "看清世界本来模样的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9470,
      "end_ms": 10750,
      "text": "你往上翻三代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00007",
      "start_ms": 10910,
      "end_ms": 14170,
      "text": "你会发现他们总是习惯把事情分成两类，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00008",
      "start_ms": 14430,
      "end_ms": 15010,
      "text": "不是对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00009",
      "start_ms": 15170,
      "end_ms": 15730,
      "text": "就是错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00010",
      "start_ms": 16050,
      "end_ms": 16790,
      "text": "不是好人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00011",
      "start_ms": 16890,
      "end_ms": 17630,
      "text": "就是坏人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00012",
      "start_ms": 17890,
      "end_ms": 19910,
      "text": "一次成功说明选对了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00013",
      "start_ms": 19950,
      "end_ms": 22190,
      "text": "一次失败就证明这条路彻底不行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00014",
      "start_ms": 22710,
      "end_ms": 24030,
      "text": "但是从你这代开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00015",
      "start_ms": 24170,
      "end_ms": 24710,
      "text": "你懂得，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00016",
      "start_ms": 24710,
      "end_ms": 26970,
      "text": "不再急着把人和事情下结论，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00017",
      "start_ms": 27070,
      "end_ms": 29815,
      "text": "而是先看程度、条件和变化。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00018",
      "start_ms": 30450,
      "end_ms": 33710,
      "text": "人与人之间真正的差距往往不是谁的态度更坚决，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00019",
      "start_ms": 33810,
      "end_ms": 36470,
      "text": "而是谁能够在别人节着战队的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00020",
      "start_ms": 36530,
      "end_ms": 38670,
      "text": "看见那些被忽略的另一部分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00021",
      "start_ms": 38710,
      "end_ms": 40230,
      "text": "这就是灰度思维。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00022",
      "start_ms": 40490,
      "end_ms": 41730,
      "text": "终有一天你会发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00023",
      "start_ms": 41910,
      "end_ms": 45030,
      "text": "其实身边的每一个人都没有绝对的好坏与对错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00024",
      "start_ms": 45170,
      "end_ms": 47470,
      "text": "只是处在不同的角度和环境下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00025",
      "start_ms": 47590,
      "end_ms": 50510,
      "text": "显化出不同的状态和做出一同选择。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00026",
      "start_ms": 51010,
      "end_ms": 52290,
      "text": "明白这一点的那一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00027",
      "start_ms": 52330,
      "end_ms": 55010,
      "text": "你心里才会生出真正的爱与慈悲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00028",
      "start_ms": 55250,
      "end_ms": 56210,
      "text": "你开始接纳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00029",
      "start_ms": 56370,
      "end_ms": 57110,
      "text": "学会包容，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00030",
      "start_ms": 57310,
      "end_ms": 58130,
      "text": "懂得善待，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00031",
      "start_ms": 58290,
      "end_ms": 59865,
      "text": "最终允许一切发生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00032",
      "start_ms": 60260,
      "end_ms": 61960,
      "text": "道德经说知其雄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00033",
      "start_ms": 62120,
      "end_ms": 64104,
      "text": "守其雌为天下息。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00034",
      "start_ms": 64440,
      "end_ms": 66575,
      "text": "鲁迅先生说古之成大事者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00035",
      "start_ms": 66740,
      "end_ms": 69765,
      "text": "必是北人南向南人北巷之人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00036",
      "start_ms": 70180,
      "end_ms": 72625,
      "text": "南北代表的是刚强和柔美，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00037",
      "start_ms": 72880,
      "end_ms": 73905,
      "text": "只有都通透了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00038",
      "start_ms": 74140,
      "end_ms": 75575,
      "text": "人才能接受多样性。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00039",
      "start_ms": 75970,
      "end_ms": 78365,
      "text": "我没有资格去评判身边的任何一个人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00040",
      "start_ms": 78570,
      "end_ms": 80365,
      "text": "因为每个人生长的环境不同，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00041",
      "start_ms": 80660,
      "end_ms": 82375,
      "text": "三观自然天差地别，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00042",
      "start_ms": 82570,
      "end_ms": 84150,
      "text": "做出了选择也不同。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00043",
      "start_ms": 84350,
      "end_ms": 87290,
      "text": "我不能用我有限的眼界去丈量别人的人生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00044",
      "start_ms": 87470,
      "end_ms": 90445,
      "text": "更不能用我自己的标识去苛责别人的选择。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00045",
      "start_ms": 90970,
      "end_ms": 92970,
      "text": "如果换我拿了他的人生剧本，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00046",
      "start_ms": 93010,
      "end_ms": 94635,
      "text": "未必能演得比他还要好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00047",
      "start_ms": 94930,
      "end_ms": 95330,
      "text": "所以，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00048",
      "start_ms": 95520,
      "end_ms": 97295,
      "text": "永远不要只盯着一个人的缺点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00049",
      "start_ms": 97480,
      "end_ms": 99915,
      "text": "却忽略了他背后不为人知的困境。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00050",
      "start_ms": 100280,
      "end_ms": 100620,
      "text": "比如，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00051",
      "start_ms": 100620,
      "end_ms": 101440,
      "text": "判断一个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00052",
      "start_ms": 101580,
      "end_ms": 102520,
      "text": "他帮过你一次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00053",
      "start_ms": 102520,
      "end_ms": 103940,
      "text": "不代表他永远可靠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00054",
      "start_ms": 104100,
      "end_ms": 105180,
      "text": "他犯过一次错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00055",
      "start_ms": 105260,
      "end_ms": 107225,
      "text": "也不代表他所有的地方都很差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00056",
      "start_ms": 107510,
      "end_ms": 110330,
      "text": "真正要看的是他在什么情况下值得信任。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00057",
      "start_ms": 110390,
      "end_ms": 112495,
      "text": "犯错以后愿不愿意承担责任。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00058",
      "start_ms": 112880,
      "end_ms": 115340,
      "text": "人很容易在失败时彻底否定自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00059",
      "start_ms": 115400,
      "end_ms": 117625,
      "text": "也会在顺利时高估判断。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00060",
      "start_ms": 118060,
      "end_ms": 121225,
      "text": "所以你知道一个人见过世面的最高境界是什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00061",
      "start_ms": 121480,
      "end_ms": 122980,
      "text": "您身边有没有这样一种人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00062",
      "start_ms": 123100,
      "end_ms": 125545,
      "text": "就是他看上去没有任何攻击性，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00063",
      "start_ms": 125950,
      "end_ms": 127390,
      "text": "你就是觉得他很厉害，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00064",
      "start_ms": 127530,
      "end_ms": 129595,
      "text": "而且和他相处总是觉得很舒服。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00065",
      "start_ms": 129860,
      "end_ms": 132360,
      "text": "这才是真正见过世面的认知高手。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00066",
      "start_ms": 132560,
      "end_ms": 134515,
      "text": "这就是鹤光同尘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00067",
      "start_ms": 135350,
      "end_ms": 137725,
      "text": "这可不是同流合污稀里糊涂的混日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00068",
      "start_ms": 137890,
      "end_ms": 139695,
      "text": "而是一种顶级的智慧和修行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00069",
      "start_ms": 140120,
      "end_ms": 140800,
      "text": "错其锐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00070",
      "start_ms": 140880,
      "end_ms": 141620,
      "text": "解其纷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00071",
      "start_ms": 141780,
      "end_ms": 143495,
      "text": "和其光同其尘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00072",
      "start_ms": 143990,
      "end_ms": 145275,
      "text": "把自己当别人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00073",
      "start_ms": 145580,
      "end_ms": 146380,
      "text": "这叫无误。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00074",
      "start_ms": 146680,
      "end_ms": 147895,
      "text": "把别人当自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00075",
      "start_ms": 148210,
      "end_ms": 149185,
      "text": "这叫慈悲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00076",
      "start_ms": 149610,
      "end_ms": 150935,
      "text": "把别人当别人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00077",
      "start_ms": 151150,
      "end_ms": 151885,
      "text": "这叫智慧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00078",
      "start_ms": 152200,
      "end_ms": 153315,
      "text": "把自己当自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e0d1a4f77167eb4_s00079",
      "start_ms": 153710,
      "end_ms": 154445,
      "text": "这叫自在。"
    }
  ],
